OL,3,GNEWSANew Bishop of Arundel and Brighton
OL,4,Aordained
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sixth Bishop of Arundel and
OL,7,FBrighton has been ordained during a
OL,8,Fceremony at Arundel Cathedral.
OL,10,FThe Right Reverend Stephen Wang, 59,
OL,11,Fwho lives near Crawley in West Sussex,
OL,12,Fwas appointed to the role by Pope Leo
OL,13,FXIV on 2 July.
OL,15,FHis instalment during the Mass of
OL,16,FEpiscopal Ordination was broadcast
OL,17,Fduring a live stream at 12:00 BST on
OL,18,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
