OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew Bishop of Arundel and Brighton
OL,4,Aordained
OL,5,
OL,6,FShortly after the announcement from the
OL,7,FPope in July, Wang said: "I feel a
OL,8,Fmixture of gratitude and trepidation,
OL,9,Fan excitement and curiosity about all
OL,10,Fthat lies ahead, and above all, a sense
OL,11,Fof peace."
